<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>Vixen</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">Ayesha Erotica</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">Vixen</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">5MEcmq1PG6BSrpGKestK1Z</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:14.555" end="00:17.983">You can meet me at my hotel</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:17.983" end="00:22.768">With nothing on under your trench coat</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:22.768" end="00:30.130">There's no wine, no dine, n๐ time for it you know, oh</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:30.130" end="00:33.428">Why don't you bring your girlfriend?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:33.428" end="00:38.128">The way she eyes me down excites me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:38.128" end="00:46.128">We'll drink some wine and find a way to get us off (Oh yeah) Lust and drugs, no intuition (No)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:54.271" end="01:02.001">Who goes first? Make your decision (No, no, no)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:02.001" end="01:09.752">If you want to I can play the victim</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:09.752" end="01:17.752">I am your vixen</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:18.329" end="01:22.130">I can meet you in the car lot</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:22.130" end="01:26.660">I'll spread out on your hot rod</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:26.660" end="01:33.774">You can come and get me only when I say (Hey)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:33.774" end="01:37.090">But I think l'm liking her more</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:37.090" end="01:45.090">She does the things I never ask for (No, no, mmm, baby, baby) You can touch and feel just don't get in the way</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:50.286" end="01:58.146">Lust and drugs, no intuition (No)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:58.146" end="02:05.948">Who goes first? Make your decision (No, no, no)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:05.948" end="02:13.666">If you want to I can play the victim</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:13.666" end="02:17.666">I am your vixen</p></div></body></tt>